      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COWBOY'S RODEO (8) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 407m at this track, taking a Grade 4/5 in a solid 23.67. Can return to winning form here if runs up to time two back. FARMOR MYSTIC (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (22.66) in a Restricted WIN at Townsville. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. FIERY WORDS (4) is rarely out of the finish, recording 16 places from 31 starts. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when second (24.07) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Expecting another good run. SUNTORY POPPY (1) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
